vices only</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":1199,"final_formatted":"$11.99 USD","initial":1199,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["Canada Media Fund","Ontario Creates","Government of Canada"],"ratings":{"agcom":{"rating":"16","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"true"},"bbfc":{"rating":"15","required_age":"15","use_age_gate":"true"},"cero":{"rating":"c","required_age":"15","use_age_gate":"true"},"crl":{"rating":"16","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"true"},"csrr":{"rating":"C15","required_age":"15","use_age_gate":"true"},"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"esrb":{"descriptors":"Blood, Violent References, \r\nStrong Language","rating":"m","required_age":"17"},"fpb":{"rating":"16","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"true"},"kgrb":{"rating":"15","required_age":"15","use_age_gate":"true"},"mda":{"rating":"AA16","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"true"},"nzoflc":{"rating":"ma15","required_age":"15","use_age_gate":"true"},"oflc":{"rating":"ma15","required_age":"15","use_age_gate":"true"},"pegi":{"rating":"16","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"true"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"},"usk":{"rating":"16","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"true"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"19 Aug, 2023"},"required_age":"16","reviews":"\u201cFor fans of VR horror seeking an immersive and narrative-driven experience, &quot;Broken Spectre&quot; shouldn't be missed. It breaks free from the shackles of traditional horror titles that rely on jump-scare and offers a far more profound and interactive VR experience. Cosmic horror and dread permeate every moment, and the game's innovative hand-tracking system amplifies the sense of presence and agency. With its generous allowance for player exploration and the absence of VR sickness, Broken Spectre pushes the boundaries of virtual reality horror, setting a new standard for the genre.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 SVG<br><br>\u201cIf you\u2019re a fan of VR horror and have a Quest 2, Broken Spectre is an experience you won\u2019t want to pass up. It\u2019s not your typical jump-scare fest and requires a lot more interaction and exploration, but the reward is a much more satisfying experience that\u2019s worth your time and attempts to move the genre forward in its own way.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Rely on Horror<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/26b112c085f9796aa2b6a6da23f86de150918941/ss_26b112c085f9796aa2b6a6da23f86de150918941.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761055152","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/26b112c085f9796aa2b6a6da23f86de150918941/ss_26b112c085f9796aa2b6a6da23f86de150918941.600x338.jpg?t=1761055152"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/b1f7d3c636fd41481f6f9e6a8067a9c0522ed368/ss_b1f7d3c636fd41481f6f9e6a8067a9c0522ed368.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761055152","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/b1f7d3c636fd41481f6f9e6a8067a9c0522ed368/ss_b1f7d3c636fd41481f6f9e6a8067a9c0522ed368.600x338.jpg?t=1761055152"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/29aea93f9df700c163a37ecdf71129a5df23ce7c/ss_29aea93f9df700c163a37ecdf71129a5df23ce7c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761055152","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1642060/29aea93f9df700c163a37ecdf71129a5df23ce7c/ss_29aea93f9df700c163a37ecdf71129a5df23ce7c.600x338.jpg?t