174dc42346c3/ss_a746d20e3cddabe858386bc51a3d174dc42346c3.600x338.jpg?t=1761055152"}],"short_description":"25 years ago your father climbed the mountain and never came back. Now he\u2019s calling for you. Experience the award winning, narrative eldritch horror game like you haven\u2019t before in the Director\u2019s Cut. Can you unravel the mystery of your father who disappeared in the remote wilderness years ago?","steam_appid":1642060,"support_info":{"email":"contact@gamesbystitch.com","url":"https://gamesbystitch.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, German, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://brokenspectre.com"}